<title>FINLAND: LEMMINKAINEN TO BUY PARTEK UNIT.</title>
<headline>LEMMINKAINEN TO BUY PARTEK UNIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction group Lemminkainen Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it had signed a letter of intent to buy Partek Oy Ab's Betonila subsidiary's stairway business.</p>
<p>Lemminkainen's intention is to merge Partek Betonila's 13-million markka stairway business with its own 15-million markka stairway operations, it said.</p>
